  "description": "Valiant (CR 207.2c, 603.2): when its controller first targets Whiskervale Forerunner each turn, they look at the top five and may reveal a creature card with mana value 3 or less, which may go onto the battlefield only on their turn and otherwise goes to hand; the rest go on the bottom in a random order",
